{"id":"40b3e2c20a74165b","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-riemann-surface.md","title":"Riemann Surface","display":"df-riemann-surface — Riemann Surface","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-riemann-surface","aliases":["58-df-riemann-surface","Riemann Surface"],"display":"df-riemann-surface — Riemann Surface","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-homeomorphism]]","[[../batch19/58-df-holomorphic-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-riemann-surface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-riemann-surface</span><span>Riemann Surface</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-riemann-surface — Riemann Surface"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4011e271034e0f2a\" href=\"?note=4011e271034e0f2a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-homeomorphism\">58-df-zfc-top2-homeomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d85f24c98c7d4149\" href=\"?note=d85f24c98c7d4149\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-holomorphic-function.md\">../batch19/58-df-holomorphic-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C)\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb C)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2Homeomorphism}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2Homeomorphism}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4011e271034e0f2a\" href=\"?note=4011e271034e0f2a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-homeomorphism.md\">58-df-zfc-top2-homeomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d85f24c98c7d4149\" href=\"?note=d85f24c98c7d4149\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-holomorphic-function.md\">../batch19/58-df-holomorphic-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiemannSurface}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RiemannSurface}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}surface}\\vdash\\mathrm{RiemannSurface}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\left(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U)\\right)\\land X=\\bigcup\\{U:\\exists V\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;\\exists\\phi\\;(\\langle U,V,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A)\\}\\land\\forall\\langle U,V,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\left(U\\in\\tau\\land V\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2Homeomorphism}_S(\\phi,U,\\tau|_U,V,\\tau_{\\mathbb C}|_V)\\right)\\land\\forall\\langle U_i,V_i,\\phi_i\\rangle,\\langle U_j,V_j,\\phi_j\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\left(U_i\\cap U_j\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S(\\phi_i\\circ\\phi_j^{-1},\\phi_j[U_i\\cap U_j])\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}surface}\\vdash\\mathrm{RiemannSurface}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\left(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U)\\right)\\land X=\\bigcup\\{U:\\exists V\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\;\\exists\\phi\\;(\\langle U,V,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A)\\}\\land\\forall\\langle U,V,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\left(U\\in\\tau\\land V\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2Homeomorphism}_S(\\phi,U,\\tau|_U,V,\\tau_{\\mathbb C}|_V)\\right)\\land\\forall\\langle U_i,V_i,\\phi_i\\rangle,\\langle U_j,V_j,\\phi_j\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\left(U_i\\cap U_j\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S(\\phi_i\\circ\\phi_j^{-1},\\phi_j[U_i\\cap U_j])\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Riemann surface: one-dimensional complex manifold; locally <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C} \\cong \\mathbb{R}^2\">\\(\\mathbb{C} \\cong \\mathbb{R}^2\\)</span></li>\n<li>A Riemann surface is an oriented real two-manifold with complex dimension one.</li>\n<li>Classification: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{CP}^1\">\\(\\mathbb{CP}^1\\)</span> (sphere), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C}\">\\(\\mathbb{C}\\)</span> (plane), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{D}\">\\(\\mathbb{D}\\)</span> (disk) are simply connected</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\geq2\">\\(g\\geq2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_g\">\\(\\mathcal M_g\\)</span> and Teichmüller space have complex dimension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3g-3\">\\(3g-3\\)</span>; Teichmüller space is contractible but is not asserted here to be biholomorphic to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^{3g-3}\">\\(\\mathbb C^{3g-3}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A nonconstant holomorphic map between compact connected Riemann surfaces has a degree and a finite ramification divisor.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Farkas and Kra, Riemann Surfaces</li>\n<li>Donaldson, Riemann Surfaces</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-homeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4011e271034e0f2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-homeomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-holomorphic-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"d85f24c98c7d4149","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-holomorphic-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [